# Interim (FB-20261002-SERVED-FILES, option (a)): files that neither the build nor the
# API functions need, so they are not served. Vercel removes ignored files from the
# checkout BEFORE the build, so never list a build or function input here: scripts/,
# partials/, lib/, api/, content/, learnings/_article-template.html, vercel.json and
# every page. The target is option (b), a public/ allowlist output directory.
/tests/
/operations/
/_experiment/
/.claude/
/.github/
